#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0746 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "Scope.Data_Structures.Include names BDS, OCCDS and the medical-device OCCDS only, so ADSL (structure ADSL) is out of scope -> skipped. Discriminating: SRCDOM XX is neither a study domain nor a dataset name of this study, so the check would fire on row 1 if the structure scope were dropped."
# Rule:Description: SRCDOM has a value that is not an SDTM domain name, ADaM dataset name, or null
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SRCDOM type=Char
---
STUDY01 | 001 | XX
---

dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
---
STUDY01
---
